<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classTelemetryConnection" kindref="compound">TelemetryConnection</ref> class implements initializing and handling message i/o on a ZMQ connection, specifically for receiving telemetry data from HDTN. </para>
</sect1>
